# 301 map: old davidedigerdesign.com (WordPress/Brooklyn theme) → new site.
#
# Source: docs/old-urls.txt — the old site's wp-sitemap, crawled 2026-09-16.
# All 33 indexed URLs are accounted for below. Preserves search equity at the
# domain cutover; inert until then, since these paths only exist on the old
# site. Specific rules must precede splats.
#
# TARGETS. Work rules point at /work/, a real page, NOT at /#work. Search
# engines discard the fragment, so every /#… rule resolves to plain / — which
# consolidated all the old portfolio equity onto the homepage instead of the
# work index, and landed visitors above the section they asked for. /#about,
# /#contact and /#services stay as fragments: those sections have no
# standalone page to target.
#
# NEVER add a rule whose source matches a path this site builds. On Cloudflare
# Pages a redirect takes precedence over the static asset, so such a rule makes
# a real route unreachable. `/work/  /#work  301` did exactly that: it was
# written for the OLD site's work landing page, but it also matched the new
# /work/ index, which was built on every deploy and 301'd away from for weeks.
# The new index lives at that same path, so the old URL now resolves on its own
# and needs no rule at all.
#
# scripts/check-redirects.mjs runs on every build and fails on both mistakes —
# a source that shadows a built page, and a target that does not exist.

# ── Pages → contact ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/contact-us/                       /#contact  301
/drop-us-a-line/                   /#contact  301

# ── Pages → about ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
/about/                            /#about    301
/about-brooklyn/                   /#about    301
/about-brooklyn/what-they-have-said/ /#about  301
/our-philosophy-is/                /#about    301
/david_ediger/                     /#about    301
/awards/                           /#about    301
/studio-2/                         /#about    301
/studio-2/awards/                  /#about    301

# ── Pages → services ───────────────────────────────────────────────
/services/                         /#services 301

# ── Pages → work index ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/showcase/                         /work/     301
/brands_01/                        /work/     301
/typography/                       /work/     301
/video-gallery/                    /work/     301
# Previously pointed at /work/el-salvador-home-building-video/, which was
# unpublished from WP on 2026-09-10 and now 404s — a redirect into a dead end.
# Parked on the index; repoint it if that project is ever restored.
/el-salvador-photo-gallery/        /work/     301

# ── Portfolio items with a direct successor ────────────────────────
